{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinationtesting\/destinationconformance"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/DestinationTesting\/documentation\/DestinationTesting\/DestinationConformance"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DestinationTesting\/documentation\/DestinationTesting\/DestinationConformance\/init(limit:bodyText:makeRevealingDestination:makeDestination:)"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DestinationTesting\/documentation\/DestinationTesting\/DestinationConformance\/expect(_:sourceLocation:)","doc:\/\/DestinationTesting\/documentation\/DestinationTesting\/DestinationConformance\/expectRequests(of:plan:matchFixture:withExtension:subdirectory:in:sourceLocation:)"]},{"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/DestinationTesting\/documentation\/DestinationTesting\/DestinationConformance\/Factory"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DestinationConformance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoding","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Encoding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","text":"BatchEncoder","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations12BatchEncoderP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Make one with the vendor’s factory, called with the kit’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":tru